        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Timeless Newbury Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe timeless design of the Newbury Cabinet Door Pull by RK International allows it to blend seamlessly into almost any decor from modern to traditional just from which of the beautiful finishes you choose. Polished Nickel would look great in ultra modern homes while the Oil Rubbed Bronze finish gives this cabinet pull a more classic look. No matter what finish you choose, the Newbury Cabinet Pull will surely stand the test of time's ever-changing fads which means you can change your decor without having to change your cabinet hardware. Plus, the Newbury Cabinet Pull is available in 4 sizes to fit every application.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:<a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-131\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Knob</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-timeless-newbury-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6631\"><b>Matching Newbury Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-631:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 96 mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 43/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-632:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 43/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-633:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 43/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-634:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
